  "change_reason": "Apply finite ROUND34 safeguards for wage recurring payment dates with 于/在, traditional 給/畢 date cues, uniquely anchored complete two-character subjects ending in 近/约/約 while preserving real qualifiers, and complete rate units after slash/per markers. Fold only 從/後/間 in date-containment boundary detection; retain date value equality, raw text, code-point positions and same-amount event ambiguity. Preserve detached-row versus explicit-slash rate boundaries, and retain bounds following traditional hour units. Stop source expression composition across pages; same-page adjacent blocks require finite expression fragments or contiguous OCR boxes, otherwise suspicious boundaries remain uncertain. Reject complete currency-prefixed empty wage/amount labels while retaining unknown or masked amounts and non-usable prose. Preserve finite conjunction bounds introduced by 及/或 and accept only complete 个月/個月 monthly-rate aliases while retaining role mismatches and ordinary-word guards. Admit complete symbol-prefixed fullwidth digits, bounded traditional one-time payment spellings, explicit recurring classifier/ordinal and calendar payment dates, and contract-listed other-money receipt nouns without inferring wage receipt or changing monetary roles. Same original outputs; no inference or label changes."
